### Standard Order
POST http://localhost:8113/api/camel/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": "1001",
  "type": "standard",
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": "P1",
      "quantity": 2,
      "price": 10.0
    }
  ]
}

### Express Order
POST http://localhost:8113/api/camel/orders
